# 01: Add application provider selection

**Blocked by:** None
**Status:** closed

## Delivery

Application composition can select a configured provider while existing web construction remains compatible.

## Design context

Under the required [provider behavior](../requirements.md#provider-behavior), selection belongs to application composition and concrete construction remains in the web adapter. See [provider composition ownership](../design.md#provider-composition-seam).

## Touch points

Application composition interface and web provider adapter.

## Changes

1. Add the selection interface beside the legacy construction path.
2. Adapt web construction to both paths during migration.

## Constraints

The legacy path remains functional until all consumers migrate.

## Done and verify

Both paths construct equivalent providers; run `go test ./internal/...`.
